    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PF Quirke & Co present this spacious four-bedroom, three bathroom detached home in the popular Limetree Grove development in Cashel. The property is located in a well-established residential area close to local schools, shops, and amenities.\n\nThe ground floor comprises two separate reception rooms, offering flexible living space that can be adapted as a sitting room, family room, home office, or playroom. The main living room includes an open fireplace. To the rear, the kitchen provides good storage and work top space and overlooks the enclosed rear garden. A separate utility room is located off the kitchen, along with a ground floor shower room.\n\nUpstairs, there are four double bedrooms. The main bedroom benefits from an en-suite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a family bathroom. The property has been well maintained throughout and is presented in walk in condition.\n\nExternally, there is a private rear garden and a shed providing additional storage. To the front, there is driveway parking.\n\nWith a B3 BER rating, the property offers good energy efficiency and lower running costs.\n\nThe property is within walking distance of Cashel town centre and is less than a five minute drive to the M8 motorway, providing easy access to Cork (approximately one hour) and Dublin (approximately 90 minutes)\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - 1.94m (6'4\") x 0.99m (3'3\")\nTile floor, access to hallway through French doors\n\nHallway - 8.62m (28'3\") x 1.91m (6'3\")\nBright and welcoming hallway, laminate flooring\n\nBoot room - 2.6m (8'6\") x 2.47m (8'1\")\nLaminate flooring, built in units offering extensive storage space\n\nLiving Room\nWell proportioned room with hard wood flooring, feature fireplace, French doors to both dining room and sitting room, access to decking and garden via French doors\n\nSitting Room - 4.96m (16'3\") x 4.86m (15'11\")\nSpacious room with hard wood flooring, access to living room via French Doors\n\nDining Room - 4.86m (15'11\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\nBright and spacious room with hard wood flooring, French doors to living room\n\nKitchen - 4.22m (13'10\") x 3.71m (12'2\")\nTile floor, mosaic tile backsplash, extractor fan, integrated electric hob and oven, kitchen island, expansive storage space with an array of wall and floor level fitted units, access to dining room\n\nUtility - 2m (6'7\") x 3.71m (12'2\")\nTile floor, fitted floor level units, access to rear garden\n\nGuest WC - 2.15m (7'1\") x 1.01m (3'4\")\nTile floor and back splash, WC, WHB\n\nLanding - 4.96m (16'3\") x 2.93m (9'7\")\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom - 5.7m (18'8\") x 3m (9'10\")\nDual aspect room with hard wood flooring,\n\nEn suite bathroom - 1m (3'3\") x 2.38m (7'10\")\nFully tiled walls and floor, WC, WHB, shower, shaving light\n\nWalk In Wardrobe - 1m (3'3\") x 1.92m (6'4\")\n\nBedroom - 3m (9'10\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nHard wood floors, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom - 3.32m (10'11\") x 3.73m (12'3\")\nHard wood flooring, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom - 3.7m (12'2\") x 4.47m (14'8\")\nHard wood flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.15m (7'1\") x 2.63m (8'8\")\nFully tiled walls and floor, bath tub, WC, WHB, access to hot press\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
